FiZWw1NzI3ODE5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:audio","name":"topic:audio","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2026-08-13T02:45:29Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T14:34:06Z","closed_at":"2026-09-25T14:22:46Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":true,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122360","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122360","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122360.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122360.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"Ends friendship between `AudioBusLayout` and `AudioServer` and deprecates AudioServer `set_bus_layout()` and `generate_bus_layout()`.\r\n\r\nSince applying buses is currently a mega-spaghetti on the server internals that can not be quickly replaced adds AudioServer::_set_server_bus_layout() as a stopgap so stuff still can work with no deprecated builds.\r\n\r\n### Why?\r\nThis entire direct Resource use found everywhere on the old API of the AudioServer needs to stop. A server should neither accept or return a Resource. \r\n\r\nA Resource should only be able to \"talk\" with the server on the internal over the servers existing API functions. The only thing a server is allowed to accept is RIDs and RefCounted but not Resources. Resources are for serialization and for SceneTree and Node data sharing. Servers ignore the existence of Resources same as they ignore the existence of Nodes and the SceneTree.\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"smix8","id":52464204,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyNDY0MjA0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/52464204?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8","html_url":"https://github.com/smix8","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/smix8/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122360/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":7,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122360/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}